<o:Table Id="o770">
<a:ObjectID>9621633A-B445-4C1A-90F1-769C353BA1CD</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>COMPENSATOR</a:Name>
<a:Code>COMPENSATOR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A shunt or series capacitor or switchable bank of shunt or series capacitors. The shunt or series application of a capacitor bank is determined by its connectivity in the network. A shunt compensator has only one terminal (ground implied) and series compensator has two terminals.</a:Comment>
<a:PhysicalOptions>pctfree 10
initrans 1
maxtrans 255
storage
(
    initial 64K
    minextents 1
    maxextents unlimited
)
tablespace IEC
logging
monitoring
 noparallel</a:PhysicalOptions>
<c:Columns>
<o:Column Id="o1045">
<a:ObjectID>043B9322-B95C-450A-BF97-9FB55B93E54F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>AVRDELAY</a:Name>
<a:Code>AVRDELAY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Time delay in seconds required for the device to be connected or disconnected by automatic voltage regulation (AVR).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1046">
<a:ObjectID>4657444D-948C-4907-8698-C08FDBB314C8</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>IMPEDANCE</a:Name>
<a:Code>IMPEDANCE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The positive sequence impedance of the capacitor.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1047">
<a:ObjectID>53743D88-FD8A-41D7-82BB-396658FEBEA4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>MAXIMUMKV</a:Name>
<a:Code>MAXIMUMKV</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The maximum voltage at which the capacitor bank should operate.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1048">
<a:ObjectID>1A2CFF6E-5338-4B26-8F56-E6082C59ED3B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>MAXIMUMSECTIONS</a:Name>
<a:Code>MAXIMUMSECTIONS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>For a capacitor bank, the maximum number of sections that may be switched in.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1049">
<a:ObjectID>24386842-C998-4A69-997E-42F9FBEEDFFC</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>MINIMUMKV</a:Name>
<a:Code>MINIMUMKV</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The minimum voltage at which the capacitor bank should operate.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1050">
<a:ObjectID>49BD9CAB-C450-412E-8973-AD5A5EC946F8</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>MVARPERSECTION</a:Name>
<a:Code>MVARPERSECTION</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>For a capacitor bank, the size in MVAr of each switchable section at the Nominal kV.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1051">
<a:ObjectID>6913E4C4-1DD0-41AB-9732-E27DC4CD435F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>NOMINALKV</a:Name>
<a:Code>NOMINALKV</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The nominal voltage at which the nominal MVAr was measured. This should normally be within 10% of the voltage at which the capacitor is connected to the network.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1052">
<a:ObjectID>4E32BBFA-CAA4-4B5C-8516-448EDEA665F6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>NOMINALMVAR</a:Name>
<a:Code>NOMINALMVAR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Nominal MVAr output of the capacitor bank at the nominal kV. This number should be positive.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1053">
<a:ObjectID>2AC3D6D5-01B9-4101-8FF4-7FA46B971097</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>NORMALSECTIONS</a:Name>
<a:Code>NORMALSECTIONS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>For a capacitor bank, the normal number of sections switched in. This number should correspond to the Nominal MVAr.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1054">
<a:ObjectID>2C609740-B741-4168-B67D-6FEDE67338A9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>R</a:Name>
<a:Code>R</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Positive sequence resistance of the capacitor bank.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1055">
<a:ObjectID>E708B2F1-3AB3-47F2-9036-008A9746143E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>SWITCHONCOUNT</a:Name>
<a:Code>SWITCHONCOUNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The switch on count since the capacitor count was last reset or initialized.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1056">
<a:ObjectID>60A17896-B1C0-4500-BBD8-497F34DC0316</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>SWITCHONDATE</a:Name>
<a:Code>SWITCHONDATE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The date and time when the capacitor bank was last switched on.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1057">
<a:ObjectID>50C3E9C8-16F3-4903-98DD-2337CFA2BF77</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>VOLTSENSITIVITY</a:Name>
<a:Code>VOLTSENSITIVITY</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Voltage sensitivity required for the device to regulate the bus voltage, in per unit voltage/MVAr.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1058">
<a:ObjectID>C98C6956-7B38-41DB-88B1-03A754FB9731</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>X</a:Name>
<a:Code>X</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Positive sequence reactance of the capacitor bank.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1059">
<a:ObjectID>B476DF3A-F18E-4E9D-9D82-E9D7F3C86FD4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>YPERSECTION</a:Name>
<a:Code>YPERSECTION</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>For a capacitor bank, the admittance of each switchable section. Calculated using the MVAr per section and corrected for network voltage.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1060">
<a:ObjectID>85E5303B-825E-4D3C-892F-6F827F1DF6D2</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>COMPENSATORTYPE</a:Name>
<a:Code>COMPENSATORTYPE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Used to indicate how many terminals compensator has. A shunt compensator has only one terminal (ground implied), while a series compensator has two terminals.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1061">
<a:ObjectID>A0A2655F-8BE1-4AD3-81BD-B8FD0D829DF6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>EQUIPMENT_ID</a:Name>
<a:Code>EQUIPMENT_ID</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
</c:Columns>
