<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Relationship between unit efficiency in percent and unit output in MW for a given net head in meters. The relationship between efficiency, discharge, head, and power output is expressed as follows:   E =KP/HQ
Where:  (E=%)  (P=MW)  (H=m)  (Q=m3/s)  (K=constant)
For example, a curve instance for a given net head could relate efficiency (Y-axis) versus MW output (X-axis) or versus discharge on the X-axis.</a:Comment>
<a:PhysicalOptions>pctfree 10
initrans 1
maxtrans 255
storage
(
    initial 64K
    minextents 1
    maxextents unlimited
)
tablespace IEC
logging
monitoring
