<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Maximum available inductive reactive power</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1720">
<a:ObjectID>775EBD01-8FFD-4D72-833F-ECA154627D35</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>SVCCONTROLMODE</a:Name>
<a:Code>SVCCONTROLMODE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>SVC control mode: MVAr, Voltage</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1721">
<a:ObjectID>7F1288FE-4D48-4556-B5CB-3298A6CA4C98</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>SLOPE</a:Name>
<a:Code>SLOPE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The characteristics slope of an SVC defines how the reactive power output changes in proportion to the difference between the regulated bus voltage and the voltage setpoint.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1722">
<a:ObjectID>F0BEC6D9-1969-43D4-8BDD-31726C067BF2</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>VOLTAGESETPOINT</a:Name>
<a:Code>VOLTAGESETPOINT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The reactive power output of the SVC is proportional to the difference between the voltage at the regulated bus and the voltage setpoint.  When the regulated bus voltage is equal to the voltage setpoint, the reactive power output is zero.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
