<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Temperature or pressure of coolant medium</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1784">
<a:ObjectID>9D335689-96E8-418F-8B5B-2685B3CF5E02</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>COOLANTTYPE</a:Name>
<a:Code>COOLANTTYPE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Method of cooling the machine, e.g., air, hydrogen gas, water</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1785">
<a:ObjectID>C0BB4397-1CB4-4C4E-BE89-07BE7CFE717C</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>DAMPING</a:Name>
<a:Code>DAMPING</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Damping torque coefficient, a proportionality constant that, when multiplied by the angular velocity of the rotor poles with respect to the magnetic field (frequency), results in the damping torque.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1786">
<a:ObjectID>B1EC4EFB-C8FC-4879-A254-56D421F5C895</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>INERTIA</a:Name>
<a:Code>INERTIA</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The energy stored in the rotor when operating at rated speed. This value is used in the accelerating power reference frame for  operator training simulator solutions.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1787">
<a:ObjectID>F451142B-FC2F-4B54-9A98-25291497ECA8</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>MANUALTOAVR</a:Name>
<a:Code>MANUALTOAVR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Time delay, in seconds, required when switching from Manual to Automatic Voltage Regulation. This value is used in the accelerating power reference frame for powerflow solutions</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1788">
<a:ObjectID>41A061F6-5691-412B-A49B-231CACC58EE4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>MAXIMUMKV</a:Name>
