</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1797">
<a:ObjectID>1BADEBA1-A86B-4635-869A-35D08998142F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>XDIRECTSUBTRANS</a:Name>
<a:Code>XDIRECTSUBTRANS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Direct-axis subtransient reactance, also known as X&quot;d.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1798">
<a:ObjectID>9B0D9BBB-F147-4426-B938-78AE0AA8F418</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>XDIRECTSYNC</a:Name>
<a:Code>XDIRECTSYNC</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Direct-axis synchronous reactance. The quotient of a sustained value of that AC component of armature voltage that is produced by the total direct-axis flux due to direct-axis armature current and the value of the AC component of this current, the machine running at rated speed. (Xd)</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1799">
<a:ObjectID>09C88435-D7EA-4CC7-A112-9FDB15BD2673</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>XDIRECTTRANS</a:Name>
<a:Code>XDIRECTTRANS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Direct-axis transient reactance, also known as X&#39;d.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1800">
<a:ObjectID>14E8D32F-0556-46FE-AD48-C1878A469FBF</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>XQUADSUBTRANS</a:Name>
<a:Code>XQUADSUBTRANS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Quadrature-axis subtransient reactance, also known as X&quot;q.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1801">
<a:ObjectID>7D922E41-DD67-4625-9183-06AF9EA14D5F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>XQUADSYNC</a:Name>
<a:Code>XQUADSYNC</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Quadrature-axis synchronous reactance (Xq) , the ratio of the component of reactive armature voltage, due to the quadrature-axis component of armature current, to this component of current, under steady state conditions and at rated frequency.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1802">
<a:ObjectID>CDC9F2BC-D28C-43A2-ADAA-299A1B4FF064</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>XQUADTRANS</a:Name>
<a:Code>XQUADTRANS</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1201276008</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1201276008</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Quadrature-axis transient reactance, also known as X&#39;q.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>NUMBER</a:DataType>
<a:Mandatory>1</a:Mandatory>
</o:Column>
<o:Column Id="o1803">
<a:ObjectID>36F6F009-DA28-4758-8AF2-3AADCCC4CD66</a:ObjectID>
